# {{packageName}}

> {{humanName}} icons for the Ichava Laravel icon ecosystem.

<!-- Badges: add only the ones whose claim is true for THIS repository.
     A registry badge for a package the registry does not have renders as a
     broken "invalid" pill and asserts the package is installable; a CI badge
     on a private repository answers 404 for every logged-out reader. Add a
     one-line note here saying why any of the four is absent, so the next
     reader does not restore the count. -->

Requires [`ichava/core`](https://opensource.simtabi.com/documentation/ichava/core/); targets PHP `^8.4.1 || ^8.5` on Laravel `^13`. The authoritative versions are in `composer.json` -- do not restate them here, or the two drift.

## Install

```bash
composer require {{packageName}}
php artisan ichava::ichava-core.database seed --package={{packageName}}
```

The seed is not optional -- until it runs the registry holds no rows for this pack and every lookup returns nothing.

This pack's configuration is registered by `laranail/package-tools` from the provider's `hasConfigFile()` call; see core's [configuration guide](https://opensource.simtabi.com/documentation/ichava/core/configuration) for publishing and overriding it.

